	"representativeCastDefIDOverride": "castDef_kos_Anton_Corrigan",
	"missionSuccessStatementOverride": "Good job.  Rather than deploying Rescue-5, the ad-hoc company designated for pilot recovery, we redirected forces to support other higher-priority objectives.",
	"badFaithStatementOverride": "Instead of redirecting forces to higher-priority objectives, Rescue-5 --- the ad-hoc company designated for pilot recovery --- was committed as originally planned.  As a result, flexibility was reduced and other critical tasks were delayed or left unsupported.",
	"goodFaithStatementOverride": "Instead of redirecting forces to higher-priority objectives, Rescue-5 --- the ad-hoc company designated for pilot recovery --- was committed as originally planned.  As a result, flexibility was reduced and other critical tasks were delayed or left unsupported.",
	"shortDescription": "<b><u>Operation STILETTO</u></b>\n\r\nBrig-Gen. [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[kosLoreAntonCorrigan],Corrigan]] may have downplayed the remaining threat to Acamar stability.  Three major pirate bands and numerous smaller factions remain active, fighting savagely as the task force pressure closes in.  One brutal engagement shattered the region—costing both the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[kosLoreTaskForceAcamar],Acamar Task Force]] and the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[kosLoreKalskagCoalition],Band of the Damned]] dearly.\n\r\nIn the aftermath, intelligence confirmed the worst: two Task Force aerospace pilots are alive, downed, and trapped in an area nominally under Band's control.\n\r\nYour mission is simple --- find the pilots and bring them home.\n\r\n<b><color=#e51717>ALLOWS UP TO MAX UNITS per Argo Upgrade</color></b>",
	"longDescription": "Move fast. Stay unseen.\n\r\nIf things go loud, finish it quickly.",
	"salvagePotential": 12,
